{"document":2,"title":"user in #0862e8bf:sharegpt_2I1TxKW_0: Thanks, this is great. I'm meeting with the head o...","updated_at":"2023-05-23T22:19:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"Sure, here is a draft letter of memorandum outlining the terms of a partnership between Kiosk and the local bank: Dear [Bank Name] Leadership Team, We are excited to propose a partnership between Kiosk and [Bank Name] that would provide financing options for our customers. As you may know, Kiosk is a social commerce app that allows people with a large number of social connections to become resellers. Our app provides formatted listings, prices, and photos of products that are currently in inventory, and our resellers can share this information with their social connections to make sales. We believe that by partnering with [Bank Name], we can provide our customers with access to affordable financing options that will enable them to purchase more products and grow their businesses. Here are the terms of our proposed partnership: 1. Financing Options: [Bank Name] would provide financing options for Kiosk customers who want to purchase products from our resellers. These financing options would include personal loans, credit cards, and other forms of consumer credit. 2. Loan Application Process: Kiosk customers would be able to apply for financing through [Bank Name]'s online loan application process. We would provide links to [Bank Name]'s loan application pages on our app, and customers would be directed to [Bank Name]'s website to complete the application process. 3. Financing Approval: [Bank Name] would be responsible for approving or denying financing applications. We would not have access to customers' financial information or credit histories. 4. Loan Servicing: [Bank Name] would service the loans provided to Kiosk customers, including collecting payments and managing delinquencies. 5. Revenue Sharing: Kiosk would receive a percentage of the interest revenue generated by [Bank Name] from the financing provided to our customers. We believe that this partnership would be a win-win for both Kiosk and [Bank Name]. By providing financing options to our customers, we can help them purchase more products and grow their businesses, which will in turn drive more sales for our resellers. At the same time, [Bank Name] will be able to generate revenue from the interest on the loans provided to our customers.\nWe look forward to discussing this opportunity further with you and answering any questions you may have. Please let us know if you are interested in exploring this partnership. Sincerely, [Your Name] [Your Title] Kiosk","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"0862e8bf:sharegpt_2I1TxKW_0\"}"}
